WEBVTT

00:51.301 --> 00:53.887
The uniform of the mages
of Jeongjingak.

00:53.970 --> 00:56.556
As the mage of Jeongjingak,
maintain dignity

00:57.515 --> 00:59.768
and exercise diligence
in practicing spells.

01:06.566 --> 01:09.277
The Spirit Plaque
given to the mages of Jeongjingak.

01:10.278 --> 01:11.821
Those who possess this plaque

01:11.905 --> 01:15.366
are permitted to access each
and every part of Songrim and Jeongjingak.

01:21.414 --> 01:23.124
Our Book of Regulations.

01:23.625 --> 01:25.043
Obey the rules within,

01:25.627 --> 01:29.547
and if you violate them,
prepare to receive appropriate punishment.

01:31.508 --> 01:34.177
Jang Uk, rise and bow to the leader.

01:57.659 --> 02:01.663
Jang Uk, turn around
and bow to your fellow mages.

02:23.268 --> 02:27.063
From this moment forward,
first son of the Jang family, Jang Uk,

02:27.772 --> 02:30.358
is a mage of Jeongjingak of Songrim.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.848
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

03:01.931 --> 03:02.891
- Good for you.
- Awesome.

03:02.974 --> 03:04.726
It feels like it's just yesterday…

03:04.809 --> 03:06.811
All right. Okay, okay, everyone.

03:06.895 --> 03:08.563
Ah…

03:08.646 --> 03:14.903
So tonight, there will be a welcome party
for our new fellow mage, Jang Uk.

03:14.986 --> 03:16.529
Let us all gather at Chwiseonru.

03:16.613 --> 03:19.324
Everything in Chwiseonru.

03:19.407 --> 03:22.869
including all of the food and drinks
has been paid for by the Jang family.

03:22.952 --> 03:24.579
So, my dear mages,

03:25.955 --> 03:27.999
enjoy and drink like there's no tomorrow.

03:34.923 --> 03:38.885
Jang Uk.
Chwiseonru. Chwiseonru.

03:38.968 --> 03:43.556
It feels like just yesterday that
Jang Gang brought that little baby here.

03:43.640 --> 03:46.100
But this day has finally come.

03:47.143 --> 03:49.687
In the end, this day has finally come.

03:50.271 --> 03:51.314
Yes.

03:52.148 --> 03:53.191
Hey.

03:54.192 --> 03:55.026
Take this with you.

03:57.612 --> 03:58.613
What is it?

03:58.696 --> 04:00.323
Uh, raisin tree pill.

04:00.406 --> 04:02.325
You take it before you start drinking.

04:02.408 --> 04:04.661
If they're going to drink
like there's no tomorrow,

04:04.744 --> 04:06.955
then, why shouldn't we show them
what we can do?

04:08.206 --> 04:10.541
I do not get hangover
even without such things.

04:10.625 --> 04:12.752
Uh, you're not as young as you used to be.

04:14.170 --> 04:15.546
I don't need to hear that from you.

04:15.630 --> 04:17.924
See? Look, you have gray hairs.

04:19.425 --> 04:21.094
It just looks like that in the sunlight.

04:21.177 --> 04:22.387
Is that so?

04:22.470 --> 04:25.682
I mean, do you not see
how silky my hair is?

04:27.016 --> 04:28.518
Such beautiful hair.

04:30.812 --> 04:31.854
Ah.

04:33.815 --> 04:35.483
I'll just hold on to this.

04:35.566 --> 04:36.901
- Huh.
- Ah. Take it.

04:56.212 --> 04:57.297
Madam Do-hwa.

04:58.423 --> 04:59.799
Young Master Jang

05:00.758 --> 05:05.471
is a mage of Jeongjingak,
just like Gwanju Jang Gang then.

05:07.890 --> 05:09.475
Are you happy?

05:29.454 --> 05:31.039
You have come so far

05:32.248 --> 05:33.624
since that day.

05:40.757 --> 05:42.258
I knew you'd be my master…

05:44.135 --> 05:45.553
as soon as I saw them.

05:46.220 --> 05:47.430
Naksu.

05:47.513 --> 05:49.015
I want you to be my master.

05:49.098 --> 05:50.975
I would never have imagined such nonsense.

05:51.059 --> 05:52.810
If you do survive this,

05:52.894 --> 05:54.729
I will agree to be your master, okay?

05:55.855 --> 05:56.939
Master.

05:57.023 --> 05:58.316
I finally did it.

06:34.352 --> 06:35.436
Mu-deok.

06:36.020 --> 06:38.356
How does it look on me? Is it good or not?

06:38.940 --> 06:42.318
I'm not sure. What would I know
about fancy clothes?

06:43.361 --> 06:46.864
Master… how does your pupil look?

06:48.825 --> 06:52.203
Well, it looks all right when it was
Yul and Dang-gu wearing it, but then…

06:54.872 --> 06:57.083
but then, it looks even better
on my pupil.

07:04.173 --> 07:05.299
Keep it short.

07:06.467 --> 07:07.760
I can't breathe.

07:08.761 --> 07:09.804
Master.

07:10.972 --> 07:11.973
Thanks so much.

07:17.103 --> 07:20.022
All right, Mu-deok.
Why don't we go drink now?

07:24.068 --> 07:26.279
Jang Uk, wait a minute.

07:26.904 --> 07:29.824
- Uk, this--
- Young master, you look incredible.

07:29.907 --> 07:31.701
Young master.

07:33.578 --> 07:35.079
You should take this before you drink.

07:36.122 --> 07:38.082
It's a raisin tree pill from Master Heo.

07:39.459 --> 07:41.461
- Ah…
- Oh, good idea.

07:41.544 --> 07:42.753
But we should share it.

07:45.756 --> 07:47.592
Right, they're good
for preventing hangovers.

07:47.675 --> 07:49.010
- Ah…
- Ah…

07:50.303 --> 07:51.345
Ah.

07:55.892 --> 07:56.851
Mm.

07:56.934 --> 07:58.436
Ah.

07:58.978 --> 08:00.396
- Oh, right? Ah…
- Mm-mmm.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.689
Huh?

08:01.772 --> 08:02.940
Wait, no.

08:03.024 --> 08:04.817
I was really going to give you this.
I swear.

08:04.901 --> 08:05.735
Mm.

08:05.818 --> 08:08.988
Maidservant Kim, come back.
Please take it. I swear I didn't taste it.

08:09.071 --> 08:10.740
Maidservant Kim, please.

08:17.955 --> 08:21.876
The one born under the King's Star
has joined Songrim.

08:22.627 --> 08:24.378
His father, Jang Gang
brought forth the ice stone,

08:24.462 --> 08:26.047
and started using sorcery

08:26.797 --> 08:29.133
and he was born from that sorcery.

08:29.217 --> 08:31.928
He will bring catastrophe upon Songrim.

08:32.011 --> 08:34.305
So why do you think Jang Gang did it?

08:34.805 --> 08:37.391
He could have ruled the world

08:37.475 --> 08:42.021
if he made his son king and obtained
the strength of Hwansu with the ice stone.

08:42.104 --> 08:44.607
Why blocked his son's gate of energy

08:44.690 --> 08:46.943
and seal away the ice stone again?

08:48.110 --> 08:49.946
It's because he is weak.

08:50.530 --> 08:52.782
He could not handle it,

08:52.865 --> 08:55.201
so he blocked Uk's gate of energy
and fled.

08:59.539 --> 09:01.040
Perhaps it was him…

09:01.999 --> 09:03.751
who killed Gil-ju.

09:04.293 --> 09:05.628
If he has returned…

09:05.711 --> 09:09.465
If it were Jang Gang, he would not have
exposed himself to the people.

09:11.092 --> 09:13.219
I suspect the man known as Master Lee.

09:13.886 --> 09:17.098
We must increase our power
before Songrim gets more involved.

09:20.017 --> 09:21.394
Ten years ago,

09:22.019 --> 09:25.106
we found the ice stone that Jang Gang
had sealed away way over there.

09:39.495 --> 09:41.038
You finally found it.

09:42.081 --> 09:43.374
Bu-yeon.

09:43.457 --> 09:45.167
Hand over the ice stone to me.

09:56.429 --> 09:59.056
To find the ice stone
at such a young age…

09:59.640 --> 10:02.518
that child had indeed possessed
extraordinary power.

10:05.521 --> 10:09.025
Jin Ho-gyeong still doesn't know
that her daughter, Bu-yeon, is dead

10:09.108 --> 10:10.401
and still searches for her, yes?

10:11.068 --> 10:12.653
Which is why I am going to find her.

10:14.614 --> 10:16.949
I will find the daughter
she desperately seeks,

10:17.033 --> 10:20.536
and make Jin Ho-gyeong my own puppet
who does exactly as I demand.

10:20.620 --> 10:22.830
How do you intend to find a child
who is dead?

10:24.123 --> 10:26.000
If the real Bu-yeon is gone,

10:26.500 --> 10:29.795
then I'll make a fake one
she can't help but believe it's real.

10:48.272 --> 10:49.565
Here. Eat this.

10:55.154 --> 10:58.157
Did you say you hadn't eaten
since leaving Sari Village?

11:06.957 --> 11:08.000
Here, take it.

11:09.835 --> 11:11.170
Have this, at least.

11:20.346 --> 11:21.597
Eat it slowly.

11:22.223 --> 11:24.975
Why is she going to the capital
by herself when she can't see?

11:25.059 --> 11:26.811
She's looking for a friend.

11:27.478 --> 11:30.773
She says that friend stole
all of her belongings

11:30.856 --> 11:32.858
and ran off to Daeho Fortress.

11:32.942 --> 11:34.944
Oh, poor thing.

11:35.528 --> 11:38.656
Do you know where your friend is?
Can you tell me her name?

11:40.866 --> 11:41.992
It's Mu-deok.

11:42.493 --> 11:46.122
The friend I'm looking for
is named Mu-deok.

11:47.123 --> 11:49.834
- Mu-deok?
- How will she find her?

11:52.336 --> 11:54.630
Wow, this is so fresh.

11:58.551 --> 12:00.386
Rice cakes for sale?

12:00.469 --> 12:02.638
Wow, what a lovely day.

12:02.722 --> 12:05.224
Oh? Mom, I want that.

12:05.307 --> 12:07.727
- Please, Mom.
- Goodness, with what money?

12:07.810 --> 12:09.019
I want it.

12:09.103 --> 12:12.189
What's gotten into you? All right.
All right, fine. Fine, hang on.

12:14.275 --> 12:16.193
Huh? My purse.

12:16.277 --> 12:18.654
- My coin purse.
- What's wrong?

12:18.738 --> 12:21.198
Uh, I lost my purse.
My coin purse is gone.

12:21.866 --> 12:24.160
- My gosh, what do I do?
- Oh, my ring.

12:25.161 --> 12:27.246
- My god! My ring is missing as well.
- Oh, no.

12:57.610 --> 12:58.944
What?

13:00.446 --> 13:02.782
Ugh, it's barely even anything.

13:05.951 --> 13:07.787
And the ring looks cheap, too.

13:09.830 --> 13:13.542
I gave them such a good sob story
but in the end, it wasn't even worth it.

13:45.241 --> 13:46.283
Cheers, Jang Uk.

14:00.005 --> 14:02.550
- Uk, they're asking for you over there.
- Oh, yeah, yeah.

14:19.024 --> 14:20.067
More.

14:23.696 --> 14:25.322
- Please enjoy.
- Yeah.

15:03.527 --> 15:04.528
So then you knew

15:05.195 --> 15:06.739
who I was this entire time.

15:08.407 --> 15:10.701
Seeing as it's in your
possession instead of your friend's,

15:12.077 --> 15:13.954
I'll take it that your friend
is no longer here.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.973
Young Master Seo Yul?

15:36.226 --> 15:37.394
Mu-deok, you're here.

15:38.187 --> 15:40.397
I mean, why are you just sitting here?

15:40.481 --> 15:42.191
Did you not want anything to drink?

15:44.068 --> 15:46.737
No, I did. I drank a lot.

15:48.155 --> 15:49.239
I'm pretty drunk.

15:50.324 --> 15:52.284
You don't look drunk at all though.

15:53.535 --> 15:54.662
I am.

15:55.788 --> 15:57.039
So I've lost my way.

16:00.918 --> 16:03.462
I lose my sense of direction easily
when I'm upset.

16:05.673 --> 16:09.051
Well, you can't really
get too lost around here.

16:12.471 --> 16:15.140
Come on, get up. I will see you off.

16:17.559 --> 16:18.811
Did you get hurt?

16:19.770 --> 16:21.397
You've done something dangerous.

16:21.480 --> 16:24.817
You're scolding me again?
Please let it go this time.

16:26.819 --> 16:28.487
I'm not in a position to scold you.

16:29.488 --> 16:31.657
Because I'm the one
who's in the wrong right now.

16:32.992 --> 16:34.201
You're the one in the wrong?

16:35.244 --> 16:36.203
Yes.

16:37.788 --> 16:41.208
I have always walked the right path
and never wandered from it.

16:44.837 --> 16:48.007
But at this moment, I stepped off.

16:51.969 --> 16:53.512
And I'm holding your hand.

16:58.350 --> 17:01.186
And I'm not sure where I ought to go.

17:06.650 --> 17:08.360
You'll be following me.

17:27.379 --> 17:28.630
Since you're holding on…

17:30.716 --> 17:31.633
let's go.

17:34.970 --> 17:38.265
The reason you get lost when you're having
too many thoughts is that

17:38.348 --> 17:40.476
you're thinking too many things
all at once.

17:41.518 --> 17:43.520
When that happens, focus on one thing.

17:44.021 --> 17:47.608
For now, focus on me.
Just follow me, okay?

17:56.950 --> 18:00.079
All right. I'll focus only on you for now.

18:07.586 --> 18:08.921
Young Master Seo.

18:09.004 --> 18:11.548
Something's bothering me.
May I ask you about it?

18:12.216 --> 18:13.175
What is it?

18:13.926 --> 18:17.012
Earlier, you said
you saw an illusion of me.

18:17.096 --> 18:18.430
What did it say to you?

18:19.932 --> 18:21.266
It said that it loved me.

18:21.850 --> 18:24.186
- What?
- Why so surprised?

18:24.269 --> 18:25.938
You used to say that quite often.

18:26.772 --> 18:27.981
Uh, I mean, that's…

18:32.111 --> 18:34.446
Was that… was that a lie?

18:36.406 --> 18:39.243
Oh, no, it's true but then, um…

18:39.743 --> 18:41.787
Yeah. I do.

19:10.649 --> 19:11.692
In return…

19:26.039 --> 19:27.541
Did he believe that?

19:29.543 --> 19:31.211
If he does, it'll be awkward.

19:37.467 --> 19:39.094
All right, all right, that's enough.

19:39.178 --> 19:42.389
All this is thanks to you.

19:42.472 --> 19:44.433
Madam Do-hwa would be happy as well.

19:44.933 --> 19:46.268
Now I can

19:46.351 --> 19:50.314
feel a bit less sorry
towards Madam Do-hwa.

19:51.023 --> 19:53.609
You've done absolutely nothing wrong,
Master Heo.

19:53.692 --> 19:56.987
She was doing fine in her hometown,
but I brought her to Sejukwon

19:57.070 --> 20:00.866
and that's where she met
that bastard Jang Gang.

20:00.949 --> 20:03.160
She was such a kind girl.

20:03.243 --> 20:07.372
How could I have done that to her, huh?
How could I have done it?

20:07.456 --> 20:10.959
Jang Gang, that awful scoundrel…

20:11.043 --> 20:13.754
Master Heo, you're drunk right now.

20:13.837 --> 20:15.255
This is all your fault.

20:17.007 --> 20:18.967
What? How?

20:19.051 --> 20:23.388
The reason I brought her here
was just to introduce the two of you.

20:23.472 --> 20:26.475
However, look at you…

20:27.100 --> 20:30.187
…with that face and your social status,

20:30.270 --> 20:32.231
how could you fail to secure
a lady's heart?

20:32.314 --> 20:35.317
Damn, damn, damn, damn!
How could you? Damn it all.

20:36.235 --> 20:37.444
Mm-hmm.

20:37.527 --> 20:38.695
It's true.

20:38.779 --> 20:41.365
Master Heo did set everything up for you,

20:41.448 --> 20:43.242
but you just could not win her over.

20:44.868 --> 20:45.911
I, too…

20:47.329 --> 20:48.455
did everything I could.

20:49.831 --> 20:51.041
I wrote her poems.

20:53.252 --> 20:54.378
I sent her gifts.

20:55.671 --> 20:57.673
But you did not tell her your feelings.

20:57.756 --> 21:00.259
Hmm? "I love you."

21:00.342 --> 21:01.718
"Please be my lady."

21:01.802 --> 21:04.930
You just could not bring yourself
to say those two things,

21:05.013 --> 21:08.058
and so you let someone braver
than you take her. Did you not?

21:08.141 --> 21:10.394
Does one really have to say the words?

21:12.312 --> 21:15.440
You should know just by looking.

21:16.233 --> 21:17.734
That's torture for the one looking.

21:18.360 --> 21:21.029
You think they're close,
but they're still far away.

21:21.113 --> 21:22.656
When you think they're gone,
they come back.

21:22.739 --> 21:24.491
You need to say it with words

21:24.574 --> 21:27.160
so they don't look elsewhere
and look only at you,

21:27.244 --> 21:28.620
and they can wait for you.

21:28.704 --> 21:31.999
If they look elsewhere
merely because I said nothing,

21:33.125 --> 21:34.251
then let them.

21:36.044 --> 21:39.214
If they do, if they go elsewhere then,

21:39.715 --> 21:41.174
it can't be helped.

21:41.258 --> 21:42.884
Uh. It can't…

21:50.976 --> 21:52.686
Hmm. You can drink without me.

21:53.645 --> 21:55.814
Where are you going to?

21:55.897 --> 21:57.941
I am going elsewhere. Elsewhere.

21:58.608 --> 22:00.068
Maidservant Kim. Come back.

22:00.944 --> 22:04.031
Please stay. Let us… drink to--

22:04.114 --> 22:05.574
Let's drink together.

22:06.450 --> 22:09.328
Maidservant Kim. Come back.

22:09.411 --> 22:11.330
- Oh, dear.
- I'll be waiting.

22:11.413 --> 22:13.915
- He's gonna get rejected again.
- Maidservant Kim.

22:13.999 --> 22:15.542
- Maidservant Kim.
- Oh, dear.

22:26.428 --> 22:29.181
So this is where the people drink.

22:29.264 --> 22:31.808
Everyone is waiting inside.
We should go in too.

22:31.892 --> 22:34.102
For the sake of my training,
I don't drink.

22:34.186 --> 22:37.773
I have to return to Danhyanggok soon
seeing that my tea has just run out.

22:37.856 --> 22:40.484
- Just pack some food for me.
- As you wish.

22:46.990 --> 22:50.660
The smell of women's powders
and the fragrance of drink.

22:52.954 --> 22:54.831
This place has nothing to do with me.

23:00.545 --> 23:02.339
I love him.

23:04.007 --> 23:05.634
And I love him not.

23:07.135 --> 23:08.428
Or I love him.

23:09.763 --> 23:12.599
Love, not, love, not…

23:12.682 --> 23:15.602
Ugh. What am I doing?

23:15.685 --> 23:17.229
Ugh, never mind.

23:22.317 --> 23:25.487
Oh, no, what do I do? Wh-what…

23:25.570 --> 23:26.822
Ugh. Right.

23:28.657 --> 23:29.825
Oh.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.526
Ah.

24:30.635 --> 24:32.053
So you're a mage.

24:37.601 --> 24:38.602
Master Lee?

24:39.978 --> 24:41.521
You are Master Lee, aren't you?

24:42.564 --> 24:46.193
I'm the Jang family maidservant.
I serve Young Master Jang.

24:46.276 --> 24:47.402
Mm.

24:47.486 --> 24:48.862
Thank you so much.

24:49.446 --> 24:50.572
Oh, no need. Don't worry about it.

24:51.781 --> 24:52.741
Huh?

24:53.492 --> 24:54.326
Ah.

24:55.035 --> 24:56.161
It's…

24:56.870 --> 24:57.954
Oh.

24:58.038 --> 24:59.080
Oh.

24:59.164 --> 25:00.540
Oh, yes.

25:08.965 --> 25:11.092
It must have gotten tangled
when you caught me.

25:11.176 --> 25:13.929
Give me a moment. Let-- let me do it.

25:14.596 --> 25:16.973
All right. Please allow me.

25:23.730 --> 25:25.273
There you go. Mm.

25:29.236 --> 25:32.322
I wanted to say thank you anyway

25:32.405 --> 25:34.866
and I've been wondering when you'd come.

25:36.201 --> 25:37.118
Gosh.

25:37.202 --> 25:38.453
There.

25:39.663 --> 25:40.622
Huh?

25:41.456 --> 25:42.457
Where'd he go?

25:43.875 --> 25:44.960
Master Lee?

26:00.809 --> 26:03.436
Is it because I haven't had
chaste herb tea in days?

26:06.648 --> 26:09.943
SEJUKWON

26:11.570 --> 26:13.947
I'm afraid Master Heo Yeom
isn't here at the moment.

26:14.030 --> 26:16.324
But he was very much looking forward
to meeting you, Young Lady Heo.

26:16.992 --> 26:18.118
Please come in.

26:24.541 --> 26:27.085
If it's a welcome party
for the new mage of Jeongjingak,

26:27.168 --> 26:28.753
Master Heo may return quite drunk.

26:30.255 --> 26:32.591
It's true. Grandfather does love to drink.

26:33.216 --> 26:37.137
My lady, shall we also
try heading over to Chwiseonru?

26:37.929 --> 26:40.599
I mean, isn't your future husband
going to be there tonight?

26:41.308 --> 26:44.311
- What?
- I heard everything from your mother.

26:44.394 --> 26:48.565
There are mages that your grandfather
has picked out for your future husband.

26:48.648 --> 26:51.610
I hear that the heir to Songrim,
Pank Dang-gu,

26:51.693 --> 26:53.820
and Seo Yul from the Seo family are on it.

26:53.903 --> 26:56.072
I did not come here to get married.

26:56.615 --> 26:58.700
I came here to assist
with the royal infirmary.

26:58.783 --> 27:01.953
Do you think the Crown Prince
might be on the list too?

27:02.746 --> 27:05.498
- With your beauty, my lady--
- Sun-i, please.

27:05.582 --> 27:07.709
Did you already forget
how embarrassed we were…

27:09.461 --> 27:10.879
the last time?

27:10.962 --> 27:13.757
Oh, we should have gotten the name right

27:14.424 --> 27:17.510
of that annoying mage so that we could
tell Master Heo about what he did.

27:19.763 --> 27:20.847
I know.

27:21.806 --> 27:23.808
We should have asked for his name
at least.

27:26.519 --> 27:27.520
Are you all right?

27:31.191 --> 27:32.734
I wonder if I will get…

27:35.820 --> 27:37.197
to see him again.

27:39.115 --> 27:40.909
Mm.

27:41.743 --> 27:43.078
Uh, that's good.

27:47.499 --> 27:51.670
Uk, since you seem to have a favor
to repay me,

27:51.753 --> 27:53.505
promise me something.

27:53.588 --> 27:55.965
- What's that?
- One day,

27:56.049 --> 28:00.637
no matter what I ask of you,
you must do exactly as I say.

28:01.763 --> 28:03.014
Yes. All right. I promise that.

28:03.765 --> 28:05.517
Ah. Wait.

28:05.600 --> 28:08.853
Before you promise, there is something
that I want to ask you.

28:08.937 --> 28:13.483
I am only asking since you have
a connection to Master Lee.

28:13.566 --> 28:17.487
Have you perhaps started
the chaste training?

28:18.571 --> 28:21.783
No way. Never.
I have never done any chaste training.

28:22.409 --> 28:24.202
No. You haven't, have you?

28:24.285 --> 28:26.788
Of course not. I need to get married
one day, so why would I?

28:26.871 --> 28:29.749
- That is such nonsense.
- That is very good news. Hah!

28:33.128 --> 28:35.130
You can go on the list. Huh?

28:35.213 --> 28:37.716
You, you, you. You're all on the list.

28:39.384 --> 28:42.137
Make sure to thank Master Lee.

28:42.220 --> 28:45.724
Because if he hadn't stepped in then,
things would have been much worse.

28:45.807 --> 28:47.058
Yes.

28:47.142 --> 28:50.603
You mastered Naksu's Tansu of all things

28:50.687 --> 28:52.230
and you almost got into trouble.

28:52.313 --> 28:56.192
Well, Uk even considered seeking on Naksu
to be his master once.

28:59.028 --> 29:01.239
What do you mean by that?

29:02.365 --> 29:03.199
What?

29:04.325 --> 29:07.412
Oh. Uh, back when he couldn't find

29:07.495 --> 29:09.622
a master
who was willing to open his energy,

29:10.165 --> 29:11.833
he just said it as a joke.

29:12.625 --> 29:14.377
Jang Uk, did you actually…

29:15.587 --> 29:17.255
say something like that?

29:17.338 --> 29:19.382
Yes, that's right.

29:20.508 --> 29:22.844
Yul, tell him what punishment

29:22.927 --> 29:26.514
awaits a mage who tries to use sorcery.

29:26.598 --> 29:27.974
If someone does it,

29:28.057 --> 29:30.643
their energy flow will be cut off
so they'll never cast spells again.

29:30.727 --> 29:32.479
They'll be exiled from Daeho,

29:33.605 --> 29:35.857
and their descendants will never be mages.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.150
Remember it well.

29:40.069 --> 29:43.615
Do not ever dare to say such things again.

29:44.532 --> 29:46.659
Why is using sorcery always a bad thing?

29:47.410 --> 29:48.411
What?

29:48.495 --> 29:50.497
Regular magic can also be used to kill.

29:50.580 --> 29:52.999
And sorcery can be used
to save a person's life too.

29:53.875 --> 29:55.877
No matter what you decide to choose,

29:55.960 --> 29:58.671
I believe that what matters is
whether their intentions are pure,

29:58.755 --> 29:59.964
not the method that you choose to use.

30:00.048 --> 30:03.218
Does that mean
that you would actually use sorcery

30:04.511 --> 30:07.013
if you thought
it would save someone's life?

30:07.096 --> 30:09.265
If I could save someone's life
with the power of sorcery…

30:10.725 --> 30:13.269
yes, I would do it however I could.

30:19.943 --> 30:23.196
You… you! How dare you? Huh?

30:23.279 --> 30:24.989
How dare you say such things?

30:25.073 --> 30:28.201
And as a… new mage of Jeongjingak?

30:28.284 --> 30:30.495
You know what,
if you're going to say such things,

30:30.578 --> 30:32.205
you had better give back

30:32.288 --> 30:34.165
my torrent of energy.

30:35.375 --> 30:37.460
- My Lord.
- What is it?

30:37.544 --> 30:40.588
His Royal Highness, The Crown Prince
is on his way to meet Jang Uk.

30:46.010 --> 30:47.011
Your Highness.

30:49.472 --> 30:50.557
Welcome.

31:06.197 --> 31:09.576
His Highness, the Crown Prince.
Show your respects.

31:27.385 --> 31:29.637
I came because I heard
there was a party here,

31:29.721 --> 31:31.514
but it seems as though I've ruined it.

31:32.765 --> 31:36.144
In truth, this party
is thanks to me in the first place,

31:37.270 --> 31:39.606
which makes me feel
that I ought to be welcome here.

31:40.231 --> 31:41.816
So why the silence?

31:42.692 --> 31:44.777
I am sure what Your Highness
truly wished for was

31:44.861 --> 31:47.655
my funeral instead of a wonderful party
like this,

31:47.739 --> 31:49.240
so though I can't greet you in tears,

31:49.324 --> 31:52.076
it would be disrespectful
to greet you with a smile, Your Highness.

31:57.498 --> 31:59.208
Be it a party or a funeral,

31:59.292 --> 32:01.502
where many people gather,
there should be drinks.

32:02.295 --> 32:05.256
So I've brought a jar for you.

32:10.595 --> 32:12.639
What if something happens again?

32:12.722 --> 32:14.265
My Lord, you should go down there.

32:14.349 --> 32:17.143
Let's wait to see what happens.

32:23.149 --> 32:25.068
To congratulate Uk for defeating me,

32:27.362 --> 32:28.696
I will pour him a drink.

32:29.739 --> 32:33.117
To Jang Uk, who became a mage

32:33.201 --> 32:36.412
after opening his gate of energy
just six weeks ago.

32:37.914 --> 32:39.207
Congratulations.

32:44.128 --> 32:47.215
I may have lost my duel with you,

32:47.298 --> 32:49.717
however, as the Crown Prince, I'm happy.

32:50.885 --> 32:53.137
To have such a great mage like you
in Daeho

32:53.721 --> 32:55.974
is something worth celebrating.

32:56.557 --> 32:57.850
Accept this drink

32:58.434 --> 33:01.646
and climb to even greater heights
to become the very best mage

33:02.230 --> 33:04.065
and make all of Daeho proud,

33:04.649 --> 33:05.483
Jang Uk.

33:17.870 --> 33:19.372
Thank you very much, Your Highness.

33:27.797 --> 33:29.757
Let me also pour you a drink, sire.

33:40.643 --> 33:43.646
May you be a great king too,
Your Royal Highness.

34:04.083 --> 34:05.710
You'll be a great king, Your Highness.

34:23.561 --> 34:24.645
Thank goodness.

34:24.729 --> 34:27.231
The Prince doesn't hold grudges.

34:27.315 --> 34:28.900
Not at all.

34:31.986 --> 34:34.197
The Crown Prince,
heir to the throne.

34:34.280 --> 34:38.367
And the boy who was born
under the King's Star.

34:45.500 --> 34:48.127
Two of Jinyowon's
precious treasures have been broken.

34:48.920 --> 34:51.631
They're useless now. They hold no energy.

34:51.714 --> 34:54.008
So burn them.
Go throw the ashes in the lake.

34:54.926 --> 34:55.760
Yes.

34:56.761 --> 34:59.347
Lady Jin, Master Jin has returned home.

34:59.430 --> 35:01.265
My father is here?

35:02.058 --> 35:03.184
Cho-yeon.

35:04.227 --> 35:05.228
My wife.

35:05.311 --> 35:06.521
Father.

35:07.271 --> 35:08.981
Father.

35:09.065 --> 35:11.442
Oh, goodness, Cho-yeon.

35:12.401 --> 35:14.237
Look at you. You've grown.

35:15.321 --> 35:17.198
Even more beautiful.

35:25.706 --> 35:26.707
I have returned.

35:30.128 --> 35:32.046
I found her on an island in the south.

35:32.713 --> 35:34.465
She lost her parents at a young age

35:34.549 --> 35:37.718
and has no memory of them… at all.

35:37.802 --> 35:41.806
She seems to be
about the same age as Bu-yeon.

35:44.183 --> 35:46.144
Is there anything that you've

35:46.227 --> 35:49.772
always carried with you
ever since you were a child?

35:53.943 --> 35:57.280
Unlike Bu-yeon,
she cannot detect energy,

35:57.363 --> 36:00.575
and doesn't know how to cast any spells.

36:00.658 --> 36:04.871
There's a chance that she lost her powers
while she was away from Jinyowon.

36:06.455 --> 36:09.250
But if she is of my bloodline,

36:10.626 --> 36:12.712
that fact will not have changed though.

36:20.511 --> 36:22.638
If you truly are Bu-yeon
of the Jin family,

36:23.431 --> 36:26.225
this door will prove it to us.

36:53.794 --> 36:57.048
I'm not the lost daughter of this family?

36:58.507 --> 37:00.968
No, it seems not.

37:02.511 --> 37:07.308
But to thank you for coming, I'll give you
more than enough to get back.

37:09.227 --> 37:13.773
Do you think Mother will get angry again
out of disappointment?

37:14.857 --> 37:16.442
What should we do, Father?

38:08.953 --> 38:10.079
Mother.

38:11.872 --> 38:13.749
The bird in the cage has died.

38:17.586 --> 38:20.298
You are right. Poor thing.

38:20.381 --> 38:23.676
Up until yesterday, I could feel
the faint warm energy.

38:25.094 --> 38:26.679
But now, there's nothing.

38:28.347 --> 38:32.435
Although I'm able to see,
you still noticed this first, Bu-yeon.

38:32.518 --> 38:35.271
All the things in the world
actually have energy,

38:36.147 --> 38:38.399
and I see the world through that energy.

38:38.482 --> 38:43.029
Bu-yeon, you may not be able to see
the things the way other people do.

38:44.238 --> 38:48.159
But you are a very special child
who sees things that they can't.

38:52.872 --> 38:55.041
You made me a new eye mask for me.

38:55.124 --> 38:57.084
Mother, can you put it on me?

39:17.480 --> 39:18.564
Ho-gyeong.

39:20.775 --> 39:22.443
Don't be so disappointed.

39:23.027 --> 39:25.905
I didn't have high expectations anyway.

39:27.865 --> 39:30.076
So you'll bring just anyone?

39:30.159 --> 39:33.287
So you're just pretending to please me.

39:33.954 --> 39:35.915
And that is why
we still haven't found her.

39:39.126 --> 39:40.211
I'll, uh…

39:41.087 --> 39:44.006
I'll go out and start searching again.

39:45.049 --> 39:45.966
That's enough.

39:46.467 --> 39:49.553
Actually, Jin Mu is going to help us
find Bu-yeon.

39:49.637 --> 39:50.846
Your half-brother?

39:51.847 --> 39:53.682
But I thought
that you could hardly stand him.

39:53.766 --> 39:57.103
Even if that's true,
as long as he finds Bu-yeon,

39:57.186 --> 39:58.479
it's fine.

39:58.562 --> 40:01.065
I'm more than willing to work
with Jin Mu if I must.

40:08.489 --> 40:10.491
I told you I'm looking for someone.

40:11.534 --> 40:12.827
A girl here called Mu-deok.

40:12.910 --> 40:15.162
Things are far too busy tonight.
Come back next time.

40:17.289 --> 40:18.582
I get it now.

40:20.501 --> 40:22.002
You don't know who I am.

40:23.045 --> 40:24.213
Who could you be?

40:26.424 --> 40:29.176
I'm a mage from an incredibly
famous family.

40:31.637 --> 40:34.390
Do you want me to prove it with my energy?

40:38.978 --> 40:40.062
Ow!

40:40.646 --> 40:41.814
You're lucky.

40:42.565 --> 40:45.192
Had there been energy in my hand,
you'd already be dead.

40:45.901 --> 40:48.904
I'm sorry. Forgive me, My Lady.

40:48.988 --> 40:52.283
This is just a brothel selling drinks.
You-- you discriminate?

40:52.366 --> 40:55.953
The mages from Songrim Jeongjingak
are having a celebration inside.

40:56.537 --> 40:57.621
- Songrim?
- Yes.

40:57.705 --> 41:00.958
And the Crown Prince himself is here
as well, so things are quite hectic.

41:01.667 --> 41:04.295
I heard that she got sold
to the biggest brothel here.

41:04.962 --> 41:06.797
But this is no ordinary brothel.

41:06.881 --> 41:09.967
If you tell me which family you're from,
I'll go and announce you.

41:11.135 --> 41:13.929
No need. I'll come back next time.

41:16.390 --> 41:17.683
What's going on?

41:19.477 --> 41:20.436
Who was that?

41:21.020 --> 41:23.397
She said she's a mage
from a famous family.

41:23.481 --> 41:25.024
I think it's Jinyowon.

41:25.107 --> 41:28.444
I just glimpsed it, but the sash
around her neck had Jinyowon's crest.

41:28.527 --> 41:29.737
Jinyowon?

41:30.237 --> 41:33.449
Well, that makes sense
since Jinyowon's mages have a reputation

41:33.532 --> 41:35.910
for being very rude
and difficult to deal with.

41:36.744 --> 41:37.870
Are you all right?

41:37.953 --> 41:40.039
Yes. It doesn't hurt very much.

41:40.122 --> 41:42.291
It's strange.
She wasn't very strong for a mage.

41:42.374 --> 41:45.044
- Maybe she was lying?
- That crest could be fake too.

41:46.045 --> 41:47.671
You could be sentenced to death

41:47.755 --> 41:51.425
if you're caught pretending to be
of a mage family inside Daeho Fortress.

41:53.052 --> 41:54.512
Very suspicious.

42:03.395 --> 42:07.149
I guess mages really do have
the most power in Daeho Fortress.

42:08.901 --> 42:10.569
Mu-deok has to be in there somewhere.

42:20.621 --> 42:22.957
I think I need to live off of her
for a while.

42:24.625 --> 42:26.585
If I tell her I came to return this,

42:27.586 --> 42:30.798
she'll let me stay.
After all, she's so kind.

42:32.466 --> 42:34.426
- Who goes there?
- Oh, that startled me.

42:41.642 --> 42:42.726
Wait for me outside.

42:43.310 --> 42:44.478
Yes, Your Highness.

42:51.986 --> 42:53.654
She should be running after me by now.

42:55.030 --> 42:58.158
One, two, three.

43:00.744 --> 43:02.621
Four, five…

43:03.539 --> 43:04.707
Your Highness.

43:06.500 --> 43:07.585
Your Highness.

43:11.922 --> 43:17.219
I, Filthy Mu-deok, was once again touched
by your immeasurable generosity and spirit

43:17.803 --> 43:19.305
as vast as the ocean.

43:21.265 --> 43:24.518
Yes. I forced myself
to overlook this matter.

43:24.602 --> 43:26.729
If I had it my way,
I would tear the place apart

43:26.812 --> 43:29.982
but as I said before, I don't wish to be
at odds with the Songrim mages.

43:31.275 --> 43:33.652
What? You think it's petty?

43:34.570 --> 43:37.364
Choosing to hide the feelings
that might have been petty

43:37.948 --> 43:41.118
was actually a very wise
and highly intelligent decision.

43:41.994 --> 43:44.788
I'll only show my pettiness to you,
Filthy Mu-deok.

43:44.872 --> 43:49.209
Knowing how unbearable it must have been
to pour him a congratulatory drink

43:49.293 --> 43:51.629
when what you really wanted to do
is poison him.

43:51.712 --> 43:54.590
I just had to come see you
as fast as I could.

43:55.341 --> 43:57.551
I hate your master so much,
it's gut-wrenching.

43:57.635 --> 43:58.761
Oh, of course you do.

43:58.844 --> 44:00.679
I hate him so much,
it makes me sick to my stomach.

44:00.763 --> 44:02.514
Yes, I'm sure it does.

44:02.598 --> 44:04.058
I also really hate seeing you…

44:05.934 --> 44:07.436
rooting for him.

44:13.275 --> 44:15.486
My generosity was for your benefit.

44:18.530 --> 44:19.531
Filthy Mu-deok.

44:20.115 --> 44:23.410
If you ever try to get involved in a fight
between me and your master again,

44:24.745 --> 44:26.372
I'll have to kill you first.

44:31.085 --> 44:35.047
Even if I die one day
by Your Royal Highness' sword,

44:36.882 --> 44:38.676
I still will never resent you.

44:39.843 --> 44:42.137
So you'll stick by your master
even if it kills you?

44:42.221 --> 44:43.639
What a loyal servant.

44:43.722 --> 44:45.808
Shall I build a statue of you
by that outhouse?

44:45.891 --> 44:49.478
Oh. Well, Your Highness,
I'm honored to receive your recognition.

44:49.561 --> 44:51.063
Never mind. Go back.

44:51.146 --> 44:53.524
Before my ocean of generosity dries up.

44:54.525 --> 44:56.735
- Your Highness.
- What? What? What do you want?

44:56.819 --> 44:59.154
Do you have a death wish
or something?

45:00.447 --> 45:03.075
Is your… your injury healing well?

45:06.161 --> 45:08.789
Well, you took your time asking.

45:08.872 --> 45:11.250
Don't worry about it.
It wasn't such a great attack.

45:11.333 --> 45:13.168
And Heo Yeom already took care of it.

45:14.169 --> 45:15.629
You were just caught off guard

45:15.713 --> 45:17.840
because you expected nothing
from my young master,

45:17.923 --> 45:21.385
but Your Royal Highness
is clearly much stronger.

45:21.468 --> 45:24.847
Of course, I am.
But who knew Jang Uk was gonna use Tansu?

45:24.930 --> 45:26.056
What a cheater.

45:26.932 --> 45:28.142
All right.

45:29.143 --> 45:32.146
That sachet that she hung by the toilet
to get rid of the flies?

45:34.940 --> 45:37.276
Where is the sachet I gave you?

45:37.359 --> 45:38.235
Why?

45:39.486 --> 45:42.114
I was just wondering if you hung it
by the toilet for the flies.

45:45.367 --> 45:46.493
I have it right here.

45:47.244 --> 45:50.581
Why would I put something so precious
by the outhouse?

45:50.664 --> 45:53.375
Right? I knew you wouldn't dare
to do that.

45:54.334 --> 45:55.252
Very well.

45:57.713 --> 45:59.840
Safe travels, Your Highness.

46:12.144 --> 46:14.480
- What are you doing?
- Oh, for goodness' sake.

46:14.563 --> 46:16.565
- Young master.
- Leave me alone.

46:16.648 --> 46:18.692
Will you please wake up, young master?

46:20.068 --> 46:21.361
- Hey.
- Look at him.

46:22.404 --> 46:24.573
He's gonna be out of it until tomorrow.

46:24.656 --> 46:25.866
He's a lightweight,

46:25.949 --> 46:29.244
but he drank every glass
the Crown Prince offered.

46:29.328 --> 46:32.164
I mean, why didn't you help him out,
Dang-gu? How come you're okay?

46:32.247 --> 46:33.791
I mean, well, I…

46:33.874 --> 46:35.125
I was busy singing, so…

46:36.585 --> 46:38.128
Put down the palanquin.

46:42.090 --> 46:44.092
Only those who are authorized
can enter Songrim.

46:44.676 --> 46:46.970
If you are not of Songrim,
you must go back.

46:54.561 --> 46:55.938
You cannot enter here.

46:57.439 --> 46:58.649
I am Mu-deok.

46:59.441 --> 47:01.401
I'm the servant of Young Master Jang.

47:01.485 --> 47:02.569
You know that.

47:04.154 --> 47:05.948
Until now, you were allowed
to enter Songrim

47:06.031 --> 47:07.783
as a servant of Jang Uk who was a guest.

47:07.866 --> 47:08.867
But not anymore.

47:08.951 --> 47:11.453
Jang Uk is of Songrim now but you are not.

47:12.287 --> 47:13.413
So you must go back.

47:13.497 --> 47:15.499
But what's going to happen
to Young Master Jang?

47:15.582 --> 47:18.961
He's completely drunk.
I need to take care of him.

47:19.044 --> 47:22.256
Servants of Jeongjingak
will take care of your master from now on.

47:25.217 --> 47:26.426
No. Wait.

47:27.928 --> 47:30.764
But I need to be there
to take care of him.

47:30.848 --> 47:32.099
Please let me in.

47:32.182 --> 47:34.852
You should really just let her in.

47:34.935 --> 47:37.521
Uk will throw a fit if she's not there
when he wakes up.

47:37.604 --> 47:41.608
Not a single Jeongjingak mage has ever
been permitted to bring a servant.

47:43.151 --> 47:46.363
Now that Jang Uk is a Songrim,
he must abide by our rules.

47:47.197 --> 47:49.283
Then I really can't enter the gate?

47:49.366 --> 47:50.826
That has always been the rule.

47:51.451 --> 47:53.662
For now, you should go home.

47:53.745 --> 47:55.622
I will bring Uk once he wakes up.

47:55.706 --> 47:57.124
Jang Uk cannot leave.

47:57.791 --> 48:01.295
Until he's done with his basic training,
he's not allowed to leave Songrim.

48:01.378 --> 48:03.714
Another of our rules.

48:05.299 --> 48:07.634
That's true. It was like that for us.

48:08.427 --> 48:09.386
You mean

48:09.469 --> 48:12.431
I cannot enter and he can't come outside?

48:12.514 --> 48:14.391
So we can't be together at all?

48:14.474 --> 48:17.519
Now you understand.
You should start heading back with them.

48:18.979 --> 48:20.188
No, wait…

48:36.705 --> 48:38.665
It's Jang Uk's first day at Jeongjingak.

48:38.749 --> 48:41.251
You want him to break the rules
on his first day?

48:48.842 --> 48:51.803
Young masters. Please let me in.

48:54.306 --> 48:57.100
If you two stay here,
she'll not leave.

48:57.184 --> 48:59.895
And if the leader finds out,
then she will be punished.

48:59.978 --> 49:01.063
Let's go inside.

49:02.356 --> 49:06.693
Mu-deok, go home just for now.
We will try to find a way for you.

49:08.487 --> 49:09.613
Uh…

49:14.409 --> 49:15.744
Young master.

49:20.540 --> 49:22.084
Please take me with you.

49:23.627 --> 49:24.878
Young master.

49:36.807 --> 49:38.266
Oh, my goodness.

49:40.352 --> 49:42.562
Grandfather, I hope you've been well.

49:42.646 --> 49:43.647
Yes, of course.

49:43.730 --> 49:48.276
Wow. You've grown up so much
since the last time I saw you, huh?

49:49.319 --> 49:52.197
Master Heo, one of the mages
collapsed at the party.

49:52.280 --> 49:53.657
He was brought here
with irregular breathing.

49:53.740 --> 49:57.369
Uh, goodness, I'm sure he's drunk.
You can treat him yourself.

49:57.995 --> 50:00.914
But it's Jang Uk.
The one you gave your torrent of energy.

50:00.998 --> 50:03.625
Ja-- Jang Uk? Jang Uk?

50:03.709 --> 50:05.502
Uk? Uk?

50:27.524 --> 50:29.317
It's the mage from that night.

50:31.069 --> 50:34.364
Oh. Uh, Yun-ok, come here.

50:34.448 --> 50:35.615
All right.

50:41.038 --> 50:44.750
His gate of energy had been closed
until I opened it for him.

50:45.333 --> 50:48.086
I gave him my torrent of energy.
His name is Jang Uk.

50:50.130 --> 50:51.089
"Jang Uk"?

50:51.173 --> 50:54.718
Yes. But this boy mastered Ryusu
in just one month.

50:54.801 --> 50:56.386
He's a genius.

50:56.470 --> 50:57.596
- In only a month?
- Yes.

50:58.930 --> 51:01.516
He is… very impressive.

51:04.019 --> 51:05.312
Oh.

51:15.280 --> 51:16.323
Uh…

51:16.406 --> 51:21.411
well, I'm quite drunk, so I should go
and get some sleep, huh.

51:21.495 --> 51:22.913
Will you take care of him?

51:22.996 --> 51:24.748
- Oh.
- Yes? Okay.

51:24.831 --> 51:26.416
Yeah, Grandfather.

51:34.299 --> 51:35.467
Oh.

51:43.016 --> 51:44.768
So it seems we meet again.

51:46.686 --> 51:48.980
Jang Uk, the mage.

52:05.330 --> 52:07.415
I've come too far to give up right now.

52:10.252 --> 52:12.003
I'll stay until they let me in.

52:18.760 --> 52:19.928
Really?

52:28.311 --> 52:29.437
Mu-deok.

52:35.485 --> 52:36.611
Hmm.

52:37.445 --> 52:38.405
Mu-deok.

52:39.823 --> 52:43.869
Ugh, your young master is dying here.
My head is spinning like crazy.

53:24.534 --> 53:25.619
Jang Uk.

53:27.787 --> 53:29.331
If you leave me…

53:31.499 --> 53:33.418
I swear I'm gonna kill you.

53:59.903 --> 54:01.321
Young Master Seo Yul?

54:03.907 --> 54:05.700
I was worried you'd still be here,

54:06.785 --> 54:08.036
and I was right.

54:10.163 --> 54:11.790
I'm not going to leave.

54:14.125 --> 54:16.670
I will not be separated
from my young master.

54:19.547 --> 54:21.758
Waiting here won't solve anything.

54:21.841 --> 54:24.511
If you stay here, Uk will break the rules.

54:24.594 --> 54:27.138
And then all his hard work
will have been for nothing.

54:29.391 --> 54:30.684
I guess you're right.

54:31.893 --> 54:33.603
For now, go home and wait.

54:34.437 --> 54:35.438
I'll take you.

54:46.616 --> 54:48.451
Please tell Young Master Jang,

54:49.995 --> 54:51.997
no matter what happens to me,

54:52.497 --> 54:55.166
I will come to find him in Songrim.

54:57.377 --> 54:59.421
So tell him just to hang in there
for a bit.

55:01.840 --> 55:04.592
All right. I'll tell him.

55:59.731 --> 56:01.566
Ugh, my head.

56:04.694 --> 56:06.279
That damn prince…

56:08.073 --> 56:09.699
Mu-deok.

56:10.533 --> 56:13.411
- I need water.
- Who is Mu-deok?

56:14.371 --> 56:15.663
Hmm. Hmm?

56:16.331 --> 56:17.415
Who are you?

56:17.499 --> 56:20.377
You don't remember? We met at the inn.

56:21.378 --> 56:23.922
- Huh…
- Misunderstanding!

56:24.005 --> 56:26.966
You were staring only at my lady
the entire time you were following us.

56:27.967 --> 56:30.428
Oh, right, So… Sun…

56:31.179 --> 56:32.639
Yeah, Su… Sun-i.

56:33.723 --> 56:34.849
What are you doing here?

56:34.933 --> 56:39.354
Young Lady Heo is the granddaughter
of Master Heo Yeom of Sejukwon, you see.

56:39.437 --> 56:40.605
I see.

56:42.065 --> 56:43.483
Small world, right?

56:43.566 --> 56:44.859
If she tells Master Heo

56:44.943 --> 56:47.779
about how rude you were that day,
you're for sure be on his bad side.

56:48.530 --> 56:50.698
That old man never really liked me anyway.

56:50.782 --> 56:51.908
Go ahead and tell him, okay?

56:54.702 --> 56:56.788
Wait, you're not even going
to thank my lady, at least?

56:56.871 --> 56:58.581
But she took care of you all night long.

56:58.665 --> 56:59.958
Wait, she really did?

57:08.758 --> 57:10.260
But she cannot tell him that.

57:12.178 --> 57:15.306
So you have met Uk before?

57:16.057 --> 57:16.975
Sir.

57:17.058 --> 57:19.853
Apparently, Yun-ok
happened to be in some trouble

57:19.936 --> 57:22.021
and Uk was there to help her out.

57:22.105 --> 57:23.440
Oh…

57:23.523 --> 57:26.734
Uk is not the type of person
to help someone voluntarily.

57:27.986 --> 57:29.904
What are you saying about
Young Master Jang?

57:31.531 --> 57:34.576
- Hmm?
- I hear you came from Wol Fortress.

57:34.659 --> 57:38.371
Both myself and Young Master Jang's mother
are from there, as well.

57:38.455 --> 57:40.415
Ah. Is that so?

57:40.498 --> 57:42.709
Perhaps it's because you're from there

57:42.792 --> 57:44.961
that you remind me very much of her.

57:46.504 --> 57:49.466
It seems you and Young Master Jang
were meant to meet.

57:51.759 --> 57:54.137
If people from the same hometown
look alike,

57:54.721 --> 57:56.973
then she should also look like you.

57:57.849 --> 57:58.892
Huh?

57:58.975 --> 58:00.935
But you look nothing like each other.

58:03.062 --> 58:04.522
I don't understand.

58:05.773 --> 58:07.358
Maidservant Kim, you're wonderful,

58:07.442 --> 58:10.320
but you tend to exaggerate things
and jump to conclusions

58:10.403 --> 58:11.738
without using logic though.

58:12.780 --> 58:15.116
What does that mean?
Are you trying to imply that I'm a liar?

58:16.409 --> 58:17.577
I didn't say that at all.

58:18.161 --> 58:19.704
See what you just did.

58:19.787 --> 58:23.166
You got overly upset
and referred to yourself as a liar.

58:23.249 --> 58:24.334
All right. Fine.

58:24.417 --> 58:27.754
I am a liar, is that right?
An easily upset one.

58:27.837 --> 58:29.923
When did I ever call you a liar though?

58:30.006 --> 58:32.258
Oh, come on, we both know
that's what you were just saying.

58:32.342 --> 58:33.593
You're the one who keep saying "lie."

58:33.676 --> 58:34.969
- I never said that.
- Now you stop…

58:35.053 --> 58:38.681
What kind of relationship do they have?

58:38.765 --> 58:39.933
You know…

58:40.934 --> 58:43.561
they are not a couple, uh, quite yet

58:43.645 --> 58:45.813
but they also kind of already are one.

58:45.897 --> 58:48.274
Goodness. Who started getting angry first?

58:48.358 --> 58:50.318
They seem to be close,
but aren't together.

58:50.401 --> 58:52.570
- You said lie first and I…
- But that man,

58:52.654 --> 58:55.031
he has no idea what's going on whatsoever.

58:55.114 --> 58:57.367
- Ah.
- Exasperating.

58:57.450 --> 58:58.451
Unbelievable.

58:58.535 --> 59:00.703
We have solid evidence and witnesses
over here as well.

59:00.787 --> 59:02.747
So what? I should be scared?

59:04.040 --> 59:09.045
Uh, why don't you tell us more details
about how you ended up meeting Uk?

59:09.128 --> 59:11.631
- Uh, well…
- Young Lady Heo.

59:12.423 --> 59:13.591
Oh.

59:14.801 --> 59:16.219
I sincerely apologize
for the interruption.

59:17.345 --> 59:18.638
Young Lady Heo, can we talk for a moment?

59:19.889 --> 59:22.475
- Oh, uh, sure.
- Ah.

59:22.559 --> 59:24.018
If you have something to say, say it now.

59:24.936 --> 59:26.980
Uh, it's something between
just the two of us.

59:27.689 --> 59:28.690
Come with me.

59:28.773 --> 59:32.485
Oh. What do you think it's about?

59:34.696 --> 59:37.865
Young Master Jang.
That's extremely serious.

59:37.949 --> 59:42.662
He did? And judging by how Yun-ok
followed along,

59:42.745 --> 59:44.289
there must be something between them.

59:44.372 --> 59:45.832
Such as?

59:45.915 --> 59:47.584
Can't say.

59:47.667 --> 59:48.543
Oh.

59:53.339 --> 59:55.216
I'll just go and see.

59:55.300 --> 59:56.426
Leave them alone.

59:56.509 --> 59:58.511
Leave them alone, you stupid.

59:59.220 --> 01:00:02.515
I thought you two said
you were curious though?

01:00:02.599 --> 01:00:04.350
How can you have so little sense?

01:00:04.434 --> 01:00:06.269
He is completely hopeless.

01:00:06.352 --> 01:00:08.438
It's like an incurable disease.

01:00:08.521 --> 01:00:09.439
Just sit down.

01:00:13.318 --> 01:00:16.571
Why is it… always me?

01:00:22.619 --> 01:00:24.162
Uh, what do you want to talk about?

01:00:25.455 --> 01:00:28.249
Have you told anyone about
what happened that day, by any chance?

01:00:30.209 --> 01:00:32.795
Following me
all the way to the inn puts me

01:00:32.879 --> 01:00:34.464
in an uncomfortable situation.

01:00:34.547 --> 01:00:35.923
Your looks don't impress me.

01:00:36.716 --> 01:00:38.926
I wasn't following you,
so you're wrong there, too.

01:00:40.386 --> 01:00:41.596
I haven't.

01:00:42.305 --> 01:00:44.891
I wouldn't talk about something
so embarrassing.

01:00:45.600 --> 01:00:48.811
I know you don't think that I'm pretty

01:00:48.895 --> 01:00:50.605
and I know you didn't follow me.

01:00:51.189 --> 01:00:54.484
How could I have told them
something I'm embarrassed to think about?

01:00:54.567 --> 01:00:55.401
You…

01:00:56.152 --> 01:00:58.738
you must think that I'm thoughtless.

01:00:59.364 --> 01:01:01.824
Oh, no, that's not
what I was talking about. No.

01:01:02.408 --> 01:01:03.326
The soul shifter.

01:01:03.409 --> 01:01:06.162
I was talking about the soul shifter,
the one that attacked you last night.

01:01:06.746 --> 01:01:09.832
You mean that person
really was a soul shifter?

01:01:09.916 --> 01:01:13.294
Yes, but if word gets out,
it will be very bad.

01:01:13.378 --> 01:01:15.880
So I'd appreciate it if you could
just keep it between us.

01:01:17.465 --> 01:01:21.219
Well, you did save my life,
so I will keep your secret for you.

01:01:21.302 --> 01:01:23.137
I appreciate it.

01:01:23.221 --> 01:01:26.933
Now that we share a secret,
I guess we should introduce ourselves.

01:01:27.016 --> 01:01:28.601
Well, my name is Heo Yun-ok.

01:01:29.227 --> 01:01:30.395
My name is Jang Uk.

01:01:30.978 --> 01:01:32.897
Yes, I know. I heard.

01:01:32.980 --> 01:01:34.774
Yes, I heard that as well. The old man…

01:01:34.857 --> 01:01:36.150
I mean…

01:01:36.234 --> 01:01:39.362
Master Heo is always bragging
about his granddaughter.

01:01:39.445 --> 01:01:42.281
My grandfather talked about me?
What could he have said?

01:01:43.825 --> 01:01:46.077
- What?
- It might embarrass you if you hear it.

01:01:46.661 --> 01:01:47.787
Really?

01:01:48.830 --> 01:01:52.500
"My granddaughter is as beautiful
as a fairy from the Moon Palace."

01:01:52.583 --> 01:01:54.127
Don't tell me he's telling people that.

01:01:54.711 --> 01:01:57.255
Yeah, he said we are all going
to be blinded by your beauty.

01:01:58.840 --> 01:01:59.966
I'm sorry it was not though.

01:02:00.925 --> 01:02:02.885
Ah.

01:02:04.512 --> 01:02:06.013
This is very embarrassing.

01:02:06.097 --> 01:02:08.266
Oh, Grandfather.

01:02:08.349 --> 01:02:10.685
Well, that's how the old man--
No, no. Wait, I mean…

01:02:10.768 --> 01:02:13.187
I mean, that's how Master Heo
expresses his affection.

01:02:13.271 --> 01:02:14.856
He also talks about my mother like that.

01:02:15.732 --> 01:02:18.401
I was also told
that I resemble your mother.

01:02:19.485 --> 01:02:23.239
I guess this is what my grandfather thinks
fairies look like.

01:02:29.454 --> 01:02:30.621
What?

01:02:31.914 --> 01:02:33.499
Do I not look like her?

01:02:36.294 --> 01:02:37.545
I don't know.

01:02:39.964 --> 01:02:41.466
I never got to meet her.

01:02:50.475 --> 01:02:52.226
How could I meet a fairy
from the moon, right?

01:02:52.310 --> 01:02:53.686
So it's difficult for me to say.

01:02:55.980 --> 01:02:57.899
So has your stomach settled by now?

01:02:57.982 --> 01:03:01.778
Yeah. I heard that you stayed
right by my side the whole night.

01:03:03.154 --> 01:03:04.447
Yes.

01:03:04.530 --> 01:03:08.075
I thought you were my servant, Mu-deok.
I apologize for my rudeness.

01:03:11.329 --> 01:03:14.373
I-I brewed some tea that cures hangovers…

01:03:26.010 --> 01:03:27.678
I hoped you'd have some.

01:03:29.806 --> 01:03:31.390
SEJUKWON

01:03:31.474 --> 01:03:33.601
Uh, hello, excuse me. Uh…

01:03:35.269 --> 01:03:36.729
have you seen Mu-deok today?

01:03:36.813 --> 01:03:38.564
I'm certain that
she came with me yesterday

01:03:38.648 --> 01:03:40.775
- but I don't see her.
- I'm sure she went home.

01:03:42.944 --> 01:03:45.613
Uh… but I'm still here though.

01:03:46.572 --> 01:03:49.116
Are you saying she just abandoned
her drunk master?

01:03:49.200 --> 01:03:52.119
From now on, Young Master Jang,
Songrim servants will help you.

01:03:52.203 --> 01:03:55.289
Mu-deok is not of Songrim,
so she's not able to enter.

01:03:57.792 --> 01:03:59.001
But, wait…

01:04:02.672 --> 01:04:04.131
It seemed like…

01:04:04.215 --> 01:04:07.760
Mu-deok thought she would be able
to follow Uk here after he joined Songrim.

01:04:08.970 --> 01:04:11.931
I could imagine she was excited
about getting to see you everyday.

01:04:12.014 --> 01:04:13.224
She must be sad.

01:04:26.445 --> 01:04:29.657
Right. I wonder if she'll be all right.

01:04:33.119 --> 01:04:34.537
Uk must have found out.

01:04:35.371 --> 01:04:36.789
He must be on his way to meet uncle.

01:04:36.873 --> 01:04:38.916
Ugh. He'll never approve of it.

01:04:42.795 --> 01:04:44.881
Not a single mage
has ever been given the right

01:04:44.964 --> 01:04:46.799
to bring in their personal servant.

01:04:47.592 --> 01:04:50.052
I cannot make an exception just for you.

01:04:50.136 --> 01:04:51.178
Why?

01:04:51.762 --> 01:04:54.473
You made an exception to keep me
out of here for the past 20 years.

01:04:56.309 --> 01:04:58.019
So why not make another exception?

01:04:59.395 --> 01:05:02.565
Is this because the master
who taught you Tansu…

01:05:04.901 --> 01:05:06.152
lives outside of here?

01:05:09.113 --> 01:05:10.781
I'm asking you directly

01:05:11.449 --> 01:05:14.327
do you need that servant
to communicate with your master?

01:05:15.620 --> 01:05:18.414
Master Lee has already proven
that that isn't true at all.

01:05:19.624 --> 01:05:22.251
He saved you from a crisis
but people are still talking.

01:05:22.752 --> 01:05:24.170
Some even say that

01:05:25.004 --> 01:05:27.757
the person who taught you
was your own father, Jang Gang.

01:05:30.092 --> 01:05:32.678
After saying
he wasn't my father for so long,

01:05:33.930 --> 01:05:35.932
now they're saying
that my father taught me?

01:05:37.808 --> 01:05:41.562
When there are special exceptions,
people tend to talk.

01:05:42.480 --> 01:05:45.566
And your quick mastery of Ryusu
and usage of Tansu

01:05:46.525 --> 01:05:48.569
is indeed out of the ordinary.

01:05:51.530 --> 01:05:52.740
Are you…

01:05:53.699 --> 01:05:56.118
really intending to attract attention

01:05:57.370 --> 01:05:59.163
by making people talk about you?

01:06:02.083 --> 01:06:05.044
I can't make him suspicious
and draw attention to Mu-deok.

01:06:05.127 --> 01:06:06.712
He could find out she's a soul shifter.

01:06:08.506 --> 01:06:11.342
If you say it's not permitted,
then I understand.

01:06:13.344 --> 01:06:16.764
So you're saying that
you'll follow the rules without a fight?

01:06:16.847 --> 01:06:17.848
Yes.

01:06:18.516 --> 01:06:20.309
After everything I've gone through,

01:06:20.393 --> 01:06:24.438
I can't risk my place here
for a mere servant like her.

01:06:38.869 --> 01:06:41.914
I need to buy a Songrim's Spirit Plaque
from the black market.

01:06:43.040 --> 01:06:44.291
Can you help me?

01:06:44.375 --> 01:06:47.461
How can you ask that
after seeing someone get stabbed over it?

01:06:47.545 --> 01:06:51.632
Also, if you get caught sneaking in
or out with it, you could be killed.

01:06:51.716 --> 01:06:55.886
I really have to stay right by his side.
Young Master Jang needs me right now.

01:06:55.970 --> 01:06:58.848
That is not true. At least not anymore.

01:06:59.598 --> 01:07:02.768
He may have needed you when he was
on the run and training himself.

01:07:02.852 --> 01:07:05.438
But now, he successfully entered
Jeongjingak.

01:07:05.521 --> 01:07:07.606
There will be servants there
who can tend to him,

01:07:08.190 --> 01:07:10.151
and the mages of Songrim
will help him train.

01:07:10.234 --> 01:07:12.403
What is there for you to do for him?

01:07:12.486 --> 01:07:14.155
Why would he need you, huh?

01:07:20.911 --> 01:07:24.040
The leader has put me in charge
of your basic training.

01:07:24.123 --> 01:07:27.418
I will be your teacher from now on,
so I'll drop the titles.

01:07:28.586 --> 01:07:31.047
All right, I look forward
to learning from you.

01:07:34.175 --> 01:07:36.177
This is our Book of Regulations.

01:07:36.260 --> 01:07:40.765
And these books are about the virtues
and prohibitions of Jeongjingak mages.

01:07:40.848 --> 01:07:42.058
Until you have memorized them,

01:07:42.141 --> 01:07:44.935
you're forbidden to leave
the training center. Understand?

01:07:47.021 --> 01:07:49.190
Yes, I understand. I'll follow the rules.

01:07:49.815 --> 01:07:51.650
Begin…

01:07:51.734 --> 01:07:53.277
…with these.

01:08:00.659 --> 01:08:01.702
Young master.

01:08:03.996 --> 01:08:05.081
Maidservant Kim.

01:08:05.706 --> 01:08:07.249
How did you get in here?

01:08:10.211 --> 01:08:11.796
I thought you might get locked up

01:08:11.879 --> 01:08:14.381
in the secret room again
for disobeying the leader.

01:08:15.257 --> 01:08:17.468
But look at you standing here,
ready to study.

01:08:18.511 --> 01:08:20.471
I am just so proud of you.

01:08:20.554 --> 01:08:23.516
As you should be.
You have every right to be.

01:08:24.266 --> 01:08:25.768
Since you raised me so well.

01:08:26.352 --> 01:08:27.937
Hmm.

01:08:28.521 --> 01:08:31.941
But I must say,
this table is much too low.

01:08:32.024 --> 01:08:33.025
Huh?

01:08:34.902 --> 01:08:36.570
And the chairs are hard too.

01:08:37.279 --> 01:08:39.073
As you know, I'm quite taller
than most others.

01:08:39.156 --> 01:08:40.866
So it's uncomfortable.

01:08:40.950 --> 01:08:44.161
But it's too bad that the rules
can't be changed.

01:08:44.745 --> 01:08:45.746
Hmm.

01:08:47.164 --> 01:08:51.794
What is your relationship
with the Young Lady Heo?

01:08:51.877 --> 01:08:53.754
What did you talk about with her?

01:08:53.838 --> 01:08:56.340
Oh, her. Nothing important.

01:08:59.176 --> 01:09:02.555
Oh. I need to read all these books.
So you should probably go now.

01:09:02.638 --> 01:09:05.891
Or should I stay and grind the ink stick
for you while you study?

01:09:06.475 --> 01:09:09.770
Oh. No, I need to prepare
all the materials myself.

01:09:09.854 --> 01:09:11.063
They say those are the rules, you know.

01:09:11.147 --> 01:09:13.691
- Ah. The rules.
- Mm-hmm.

01:09:13.774 --> 01:09:14.984
All right, then.

01:09:16.110 --> 01:09:19.238
I'll just be on my way now.
I'll see myself out.

01:09:19.321 --> 01:09:21.323
Oh. But, wait.

01:09:23.159 --> 01:09:26.745
Please take good care of Mu-deok.
I bet she's worried about me right now.

01:09:26.829 --> 01:09:29.331
What does she have to worry about
when you're doing so well?

01:09:29.415 --> 01:09:30.416
I bet she's happy.

01:09:32.042 --> 01:09:34.712
To be honest, don't you think
she's been through enough?

01:09:34.795 --> 01:09:38.257
In that mountain valley,
she had to cook three meals a day

01:09:38.340 --> 01:09:41.218
to suit your fussy appetite,
prepare your baths,

01:09:41.302 --> 01:09:44.471
and wash all your clothes.
Do you know how much work that is?

01:09:47.183 --> 01:09:49.143
Mu-deok really did go through a lot.

01:09:49.226 --> 01:09:53.439
I'm going to take her out
to go see flowers and eat tasty food.

01:09:54.023 --> 01:09:55.733
I'll take good care of her.

01:09:55.816 --> 01:09:58.360
Without you around, Mu-deok can relax.

01:10:02.031 --> 01:10:03.240
Is that right?

01:10:11.665 --> 01:10:13.918
Jang Uk has already achieved his goal.

01:10:14.418 --> 01:10:16.921
Perhaps he wants to get rid of
a master like me.

01:10:17.630 --> 01:10:19.590
He abandoned 12 other masters after all.

01:10:20.382 --> 01:10:23.510
I should have poisoned him again
or maybe use blackmail.

01:10:24.094 --> 01:10:25.971
Maybe I trusted Jang Uk too much.

01:10:26.555 --> 01:10:28.599
Mu-deok. Mu-deok.

01:10:29.433 --> 01:10:30.434
Mu-deok.

01:10:31.018 --> 01:10:32.394
You found a Spirit Plaque?

01:10:32.478 --> 01:10:35.397
No, but you should consider
taking a test to enter Songrim.

01:10:36.106 --> 01:10:38.067
You want me to become a Songrim mage?

01:10:38.150 --> 01:10:40.736
Are you mad? That's ridiculous.

01:10:41.487 --> 01:10:44.198
No, it's not that.
Songrim is currently hiring.

01:10:44.281 --> 01:10:47.493
The competition is so fierce
they're even holding a contest.

01:10:47.576 --> 01:10:48.953
Contest you said.

01:10:49.036 --> 01:10:50.788
RECRUITING SERVANTS FOR SONGRIM

01:10:50.871 --> 01:10:53.582
Ugh. They're only hiring servants.

01:10:53.666 --> 01:10:56.001
What do you mean? You are a servant.

01:10:56.085 --> 01:11:00.172
I-I know. But I'm not an ordinary servant.

01:11:00.256 --> 01:11:01.507
I'm not doing this.

01:11:02.132 --> 01:11:04.385
Why are you so angry? Huh?

01:11:04.468 --> 01:11:06.303
Do you know how hard it is to pass?

01:11:09.223 --> 01:11:11.308
Mu-deok, you look exhausted.

01:11:11.392 --> 01:11:12.977
Have some chicken before you go.

01:11:13.477 --> 01:11:14.728
Hah. Goodness.

01:11:18.857 --> 01:11:20.025
Maidservant Kim.

01:11:20.109 --> 01:11:22.569
Are you coming from Songrim?
You saw the young master?

01:11:22.653 --> 01:11:25.531
Yes, I just went there.
He's doing very well.

01:11:26.240 --> 01:11:28.701
What does he want me to do now?

01:11:28.784 --> 01:11:30.035
When is he coming for me?

01:11:30.119 --> 01:11:32.204
He wants you to stay here and be happy.

01:11:32.288 --> 01:11:34.456
Enjoy the flowers
and go eat delicious food.

01:11:35.374 --> 01:11:39.837
He said to enjoy flowers
and eat good food?

01:11:39.920 --> 01:11:41.005
Yeah.

01:11:44.591 --> 01:11:47.928
And he didn't say when he would come
to see me at all?

01:11:48.012 --> 01:11:50.306
He can't leave because of the rules,
you see.

01:11:50.389 --> 01:11:53.559
He's determined to follow the rules now,

01:11:53.642 --> 01:11:56.228
so I have no worries anymore. None at all.

01:11:58.981 --> 01:12:02.026
So Uk has no intentions
of keeping me by his side.

01:12:04.236 --> 01:12:05.321
Mu-deok.

01:12:06.572 --> 01:12:10.993
Do you know which woman the Young Master
has feelings for by chance?

01:12:12.786 --> 01:12:14.788
I wonder if it could be
the young lady I saw today.

01:12:14.872 --> 01:12:17.958
A young lady? He met someone already?

01:12:18.042 --> 01:12:20.002
You see, he told me

01:12:20.586 --> 01:12:22.796
that his heart belongs to a woman

01:12:22.880 --> 01:12:26.425
who is like a bird's egg
at the top of a tall tree.

01:12:35.351 --> 01:12:39.063
Apparently,
he is the only person she has.

01:12:40.314 --> 01:12:43.192
I could tell how much he cared about her.

01:12:43.275 --> 01:12:45.778
You understand when a man feels that way.

01:12:48.364 --> 01:12:49.740
He's in love.

01:12:53.118 --> 01:12:55.412
But I am Uk's bird's egg though.

01:13:01.210 --> 01:13:02.461
Bird's eggs.

01:13:02.544 --> 01:13:06.673
Master, let us stay forever loyal
and dutiful to each other.

01:13:13.055 --> 01:13:14.807
I came back from the dead,
thanks to you.

01:13:14.890 --> 01:13:16.225
My crazy master.

01:13:20.145 --> 01:13:23.899
As master and pupil,
our relationship can only last until

01:13:23.982 --> 01:13:26.944
you become the best
and help me get my energy back.

01:13:27.027 --> 01:13:28.153
Then the contract's over.

01:13:28.237 --> 01:13:30.989
As soon as my energy returns
and I become Naksu once again,

01:13:31.073 --> 01:13:33.033
we will no longer be master and pupil.

01:13:34.493 --> 01:13:36.328
Is there a reason
you're insisting on this?

01:13:37.704 --> 01:13:41.500
Because you won't have reason
to protect me,

01:13:42.167 --> 01:13:43.961
nor will I have anything left to…

01:13:47.131 --> 01:13:48.382
show or teach you.

01:13:49.425 --> 01:13:51.385
Stop it. It's me, Jang Uk.

01:14:09.194 --> 01:14:10.863
Man, what am I going to do now?

01:14:12.072 --> 01:14:13.198
This is bad.

01:14:19.204 --> 01:14:20.205
I miss Mu-deok.

01:14:22.124 --> 01:14:23.417
I just miss her so much.

01:14:58.118 --> 01:15:00.287
I have no intention of training Jang Uk.

01:15:00.370 --> 01:15:04.082
So you didn't accept him into Songrim.
You merely trapped him.

01:15:04.166 --> 01:15:05.667
Somebody help me!

01:15:07.127 --> 01:15:08.754
It was definitely her.

01:15:08.837 --> 01:15:11.298
Where could she have gone
just when I needed her, huh?

01:15:11.381 --> 01:15:12.466
Young master!

01:15:13.383 --> 01:15:14.760
What is a letter?

01:15:14.843 --> 01:15:17.429
As long as it reveals your heart,
then it's a letter.

01:15:17.513 --> 01:15:18.764
There's a young lady

01:15:18.847 --> 01:15:20.682
our young master is quite taken with.

01:15:20.766 --> 01:15:22.184
He's in love.

01:15:22.267 --> 01:15:24.061
This is much harder than I thought.

01:15:24.144 --> 01:15:26.063
Your Royal Highness.

01:15:26.146 --> 01:15:28.065
She was always at Uk's side.

01:15:28.148 --> 01:15:30.192
When you are reading things,
you cannot see.

01:15:30.275 --> 01:15:31.360
You must focus.

01:15:31.443 --> 01:15:32.861
Mu-deok.
